+## Outcome
+
+This revision is test-only, as required by the CR revision 11 verdict. It adds
+public-entry boundary proofs in `internal/canonicaljson/boundary_constraints_test.go`.
+No production implementation, pinned specification, README, catalog, or validation
+configuration was changed by this run.
+
+The table-driven production-entry test now carries accept-at-bound and
+refuse-past-bound cases for all 15 rev11 findings through both
+`CalculateObjectIdentity` and `VerifyObjectIdentity`:
