+- BlobChunk size 4,194,304; GitIndex version lower edge 2; GitIndexEntry mode
+  uint32; Board Identity logical ID 128 characters; managed-tree project config
+  paths 256; GitSubmodule repository identity 256 characters; initialized
+  GitSubmodule project config paths 256.
+- Non-empty task element ID, board goal ID, argv element, managed-tree identity,
+  Git workspace repository identity, Git remote name, GitSubmodule repository
